{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b 8D (Eight Disciplines)} \u10003 ? \u8212- Ford Motor Company (1987). {\i Team Oriented Problem Solving Manual}. Evolved from TQM; in wide use in automotive and aerospace. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eight_disciplines_problem_solving"}}{\fldrslt{\ul
Wikipedia
